CodedMails templates — terms as published.

Website FAQ (https://codedmails.com/#faqs, retrieved 2026-09-07):

  "Yes — 100% free and open-source. All 60+ templates, 12 themes, MJML
  source files, and compiled HTML are available at no cost."

  "Can I use these for commercial or client work?
   Absolutely. You're free to use these templates in any personal, freelance,
   or commercial project. There are no licensing restrictions on usage."

